ysnoovwPGicmWnLEsBAQMZWce4nXskiagnI0HBqfvUveZDHYPk3iafMiaI/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, {"reviewId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V", "content": "你说的不对吧？PPI越高说明生产成本越高，此时CPI物价水平越低，企业利润就越低；PPI越低说明生产成本越低，此时CPI物价水平越高，企业利润就越高", "commentId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V_c365275233_87HcDCBS4", "userVid": 365275233, "createTime": 1773826136, "likesCount": 1, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 365275233, "name": "鱼非余", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL8KQHSx0SMQiaFp0m62UpOnSb9yPia8O1fP6AZgHqBs6GPOfYyfKyC5Omx6q7ejOSHibSyeSTWTbJwsicuniaOUv30OWqeZ0e0icVmUypEqz6Ab2PA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"reviewId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V", "content": "PPI是企业出厂价，不是成本价，PPI越高收入端获利越多，CPI越高终端消费品涨价只能说明东西贵但是这里不计入企业成本同样不能说明企业利润越高", "toUserVid": 365275233, "toCommentId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V_c365275233_87HcDCBS4", "commentId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V_c254854030_87HeySWVE", "userVid": 254854030, "createTime": 1773827899, "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 365275233, "name": "鱼非余", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL8KQHSx0SMQiaFp0m62UpOnSb9yPia8O1fP6AZgHqBs6GPOfYyfKyC5Omx6q7ejOSHibSyeSTWTbJwsicuniaOUv30OWqeZ0e0icVmUypEqz6Ab2PA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"content": "PPI越高不是意味着原料价格越高吗？总不可能原料价格低，PPI反而高吧？它俩不应该是正相关吗？", "reviewId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V", "toCommentId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V_c254854030_87HeySWVE", "toUserVid": 254854030, "commentId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V_c365275233_87HeSeCGt", "userVid": 365275233, "createTime": 1773828184, "author": {"userVid": 365275233, "name": "鱼非余", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL8KQHSx0SMQiaFp0m62UpOnSb9yPia8O1fP6AZgHqBs6GPOfYyfKyC5Omx6q7ejOSHibSyeSTWTbJwsicuniaOUv30OWqeZ0e0icVmUypEqz6Ab2PA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "replyUser": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, {"reviewId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V", "content": "PPI确实接近成本价，但是不等于成本价，差值扩大的意思是说……企业出货2块，终端买的是8块，这里差值6；企业出货2块，终端买的20块这里差值是12，那肯定是差值越大越说明这个行业是有利润可图的。假设一条轮胎成本200出厂240销售450，这个成本不影响出厂和销售差这个概念，那成本不变的前提下当然是出厂价越高利润越高", "toUserVid": 365275233, "toCommentId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V_c365275233_87HeSeCGt", "commentId": "254854030_85ESVGA1V_c254854030_87Hj06sev", "userVid": 25485